{"id":"sostoyanie","lemma":"состояние","pos":"noun","rank":807,"glosses":["state, status, condition","fortune, capital, bankroll"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6a/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%8F%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%8F%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"состояния","plural":"состояния"},"examples":[{"text":"Мой отец оставил мне большое состояние.","en":"My father left me a large fortune.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"to leave","l":"оставить"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"big, large, great","l":"большой"},null]},{"text":"Я сделал себе состояние.","en":"I made a fortune.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"myself","l":"себя"},null]},{"text":"Он оставил жене огромное состояние.","en":"He left his wife an enormous fortune.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to leave","l":"оставить"},null,{"g":"huge, vast, enormous","l":"огромный"},null]},{"text":"Он унаследует большое состояние.","en":"He will come into a large fortune.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"big, large, great","l":"большой"},null]},{"text":"Этот бриллиант стоит целого состояния.","en":"This diamond costs a fortune.","words":[{"g":"this/that one"},{"g":"diamond"},{"g":"to stand","l":"стоять"},{"g":"the whole","l":"целое"},null]}]}